# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository (standard cross-platform setup).
# Prevents CRLF/LF churn when editing on Windows/WSL.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The pinned OpenAPI snapshot. `scripts/refresh-schema.mjs` rewrites it and
# `src/types.schema.test.ts` reads it, so a CRLF round-trip on Windows would
# show the whole file as changed on every refresh and bury the one structural
# change somebody needs to review.
schema/openapi.snapshot.json text eol=lf

# Explicit binaries (never normalize).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
